### Product feedback backend: sample calls (VS Code "REST Client" or IntelliJ HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:8081

### Demo households and what each one tests
GET {{base}}/api/admin/customers

### --- MAIN FLOW: Kabir (106), Ghee, rate exactly 4 -> buy again

### 1. Home screen asks for a card
GET {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/next
X-Customer-Id: 106

### 2. One-tap rating (use promptId from step 1)
POST {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/353/rating
X-Customer-Id: 106
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 4 }

### 3. Buy again for a picked date (use feedbackId from step 2)
POST {{base}}/api/cart/items
X-Customer-Id: 106
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "GHEE", "quantity": 1, "deliveryDate": "2026-11-06", "feedbackId": 348 }

### --- LOW RATING: Asha (101), Paneer, rate 2 -> issue details

GET {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/next
X-Customer-Id: 101

###
POST {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/350/rating
X-Customer-Id: 101
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 2 }

###
PUT {{base}}/api/feedback/349/issues
X-Customer-Id: 101
Content-Type: application/json

{ "issueCodes": ["SMELL", "NEAR_EXPIRY"], "note": "Smelled sour when opened" }

### --- SKIP: Neha (105)
POST {{base}}/api/feedback-prompts/352/skip
X-Customer-Id: 105

### --- Why does (or doesn't) a household get a card?
GET {{base}}/api/admin/customers/104/eligibility

### --- Time travel
POST {{base}}/api/admin/clock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plusDays": 2 }

###
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/clock

### Reset demo data (relative to the current simulated date)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/reset-demo-data

### --- Dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/summary

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/summary?productId=PANEER&area=Sector 45

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/feedback?maxRating=3&size=10

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/filters
